My first try as a pacifist...to make things not too easy FareWell decided to go as lawful human priest. Staffed with the complicated spell of extra healing it took ages to get alignment at the right level. After the mines she did sokoban without any trouble, giving a boH. A short discussion with the Oracle was a good experience, boosting  her up to L3 (exp 41). Somehow during the game she got another experience-point (42) - no idea why??? A throne gave the first wish, asked for speed boots.
After cancelling Medusa and putting her to sleep she was no problem for my pets.  
The castle was pure fun, just had to sit back, relax and teleport the hissing creatures away. The /oW gave only one wish, asked for a magic marker and charged it up.
Right now FareWell is L5 in the valley of the death. 2*D (Speedy-L 21, Freaky-L23), 1*L (Mustang-L37) and 1*H (Murky-L24) are the pets. 
Now to my questions: Should I level up myself and do the Quest? Or better first go deeper into the dungeon? Level up Mustang to be ready for the big nasties? Problem I see here is that he only does cold damage, maybe not the right pet for the later game. Right now I'm a little short on potions, but wishing for them sounds like a real vaste of resources to me. Still four whishes are left...

